地勾勒出人物轮廓，形成自然的明暗过渡。画面采用中近景构图，人物占据画面中心偏右位置，栏杆横贯前景，引导视线聚焦于人物面部与上半身。光影从上方偏左投射，面部受光均匀，鼻梁与颧骨有自然高光，发丝与衣料边缘带有轻微阴影，增强立体感。整体氛围清新、温暖、宁静，带有青春校园的文艺气息，仿佛是午后阳光下的一瞬定格，既有日常生活的自然感，又蕴含细腻的艺术美感。画面色调以暖白、卡其与天蓝为主，色彩和谐统一，营造出柔和舒适的视觉体验。镜头轻微虚化背景，突出主体，营造出浅景深效果，使人物从环境中自然分离，增强画面层次感。整体风格偏向真实感与艺术感兼具的日常拍摄，仿佛由专业相机在自然光线下捕捉，细节丰富，质感细腻，具有电影般的柔焦与层次感。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 400, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [406.6141357421875, 465.18719482421875], "pos": [320.4069519042969, 629.510498046875], "id": 262, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 23}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [388], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"name": "original_size", "label": "original_size", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [303.6851501464844, 330], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-645.6336669921875, 621.2036743164062], "widgets_values": ["original", 1, 1, "crop", "lanczos", "8", "longest", 1920, "#000000"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 543, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "mask", "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_width"}, "name": "proportional_width", "label": "proportional_width",